3D Pipes for Android TV
=======================

An independent recreation of the look and behaviour of the Windows 3D Pipes screensaver. It contains
no Microsoft code, images or sounds.

Third-party material
--------------------

1j01/pipes (MIT, Copyright (c) 2018 Isaiah Odhner) -- https://github.com/1j01/pipes
  The growth rules (a lattice, straight about half the time, ball joints one third of turns in mixed
  mode, a teapot joint on rare turns), the ball joint and teapot sizes (1.5 x the pipe radius), and the
  idea of a dissolve between scenes were read from this project. Its licence text:

