three.js TeapotBufferGeometry (MIT, Eric Haines / three.js authors) -- https://threejs.org
  tools/gen_teapot.py is a direct port of its Bezier tessellation of the Utah teapot (Martin Newell,
  1975). app/src/main/assets/teapot.bin is generated from that data.

Reference footage
-----------------

The look, camera, colours, population and scene timing were measured from public footage of the
original screensaver, "3d Pipes Screensaver 10 Hours" by DoctorDothraki (https://youtu.be/tCpnDTzRAjE).
No footage is included in this repository.
